OL,3,GNEWSAClosed city centre cinema to
OL,4,Abecome new nightclub
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to transform a former city centre
OL,7,Fcinema into a nightclub have been
OL,8,Fapproved.
OL,10,FCouncillors on Bristol City Council's
OL,11,Flicensing sub-committee said the
OL,12,Fproposals for the former Odeon on Union
OL,13,FStreet, in Broadmead, including
OL,14,Fallowing it to remain open until 05:00,
OL,15,Fwere "fantastic".
OL,17,FSolicitors representing the applicants,
OL,18,FUG Arts, pointed out that the building
OL,19,Falready had a 24-hour entertainment
OL,20,Flicense.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
