OL,3,GNEWSAClosed city centre cinema to
OL,4,Abecome new nightclub
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's hard to imagine what else that
OL,7,Fspace could be used for," Ewen
OL,8,FMacgregor, for UG Arts, said.
